OL,3,GNEWSANew paving laid in latest phase of
OL,4,Amarket revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew paving is being laid in the latest
OL,7,Fphase of a major revamp of Leicester
OL,8,FMarket.
OL,10,FCity council officials said porphyry
OL,11,Fflagstones were now being put in place
OL,12,Fas part of the #9.4m project.
OL,14,FOfficials said they were pressing on
OL,15,Fwith the scheme in the hope it would be
OL,16,Fcompleted by the end of the year.
OL,18,FHowever, they have also approved a
OL,19,Fmajor revision of the project to
OL,20,Fincrease the number of stalls in the
OL,21,Fnew-look market from 48 to 72.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
